# 03. Authoritative 13-Screen Registry

AEGIS contains exactly these 13 screens.

| # | Screen | Primary Function |
|---|---|---|
| 01 | Live Surveillance | Continuous operational observation |
| 02 | Threat Discovery | Surface and characterize candidate threats |
| 03 | Threat Overview | Establish the current threat picture |
| 04 | Risk Overview | Assess operational risk |
| 05 | Investigation View | Conduct structured investigation |
| 06 | Case Investigation View | Examine individual cases and relationships |
| 07 | Transmission View | Understand possible transmission pathways |
| 08 | Containment View | Manage containment planning and status |
| 09 | Response View | Coordinate active response |
| 10 | Recovery View | Monitor stabilization and recovery |
| 11 | Preparedness View | Convert event learning into future readiness |
| 12 | Research View | Provide deeper analytical/scientific context |
