# 07. Global State Relationship

The screens consume and modify portions of one operational state.

Conceptually:

```text
AEGIS GLOBAL STATE

├── Surveillance
├── Events
├── Threats
├── Risk
├── Investigations
├── Cases
├── Transmission
├── Containment
├── Response
├── Recovery
├── Preparedness
├── Research Context
├── Executive Context
├── Evidence
├── Users / Roles
├── Audit History
└── System Status
```

Not every screen owns these domains.

A screen is a **consumer and/or controlled mutator** of domain state.

