# 29. High-Stakes UX Requirements

AEGIS must prioritize:

## Clarity over decoration

Information must be quickly understandable.

## Authority over theatrics

The interface should communicate clinical and operational seriousness rather than gaming aesthetics.

## Evidence over assumption

The system should show what supports a conclusion.

## Context over isolated numbers

Telemetry must retain operational meaning.

## Reversibility where possible

The interface should make consequential actions deliberate.

## Traceability

Users must be able to understand how the current state emerged.

